# tools/l/locality_key_witness.rish -- a key that carries locality sells evenness and
# confidentiality, and the three are one quantity read three ways.
#
# WHY THIS RUNG. Two readings in the Diffuser lane died on one property rather than on two.
# tools/t/torus_fold_witness.rish killed the adjacency half of row 5 of
# active-designing/20260910-060204_the-bounded-torus-moonshots.md, and tools/t/torus_place_witness.rish
# killed its placement remainder; both closes name the SAME remaining door in the same words -- a
# key built to carry locality on purpose, which no row in that page proposed. This rung opens it,
# and the answer is a price rather than a yes.
#
# THE KEY PRICED, and why the crudest member of its family. The file's own leading two bytes, read
# as a number. Two files beginning alike get keys sitting alike, by construction, with no hashing
# and no parameter a reader must take on trust. A real design would reach for a similarity-
# preserving sketch instead; the trade measured here belongs to the FAMILY, and the crudest member
# shows it at full size.
#
# WHAT IT BUYS, read at its extreme rather than as a correlation. A real file is copied, ONE byte
# is flipped at offset 32 -- well past the key -- and both keys are asked whether they noticed.
# Read 20260915 over the tree's own tracked bytes: the prefix key survived every probe and the
# digest survived none. Across the population, two files from the same top-level room sat 0.410
# cells apart under the prefix key and 15.693 apart under the digest, against the 16.000 that two
# independent uniform keys give on 64 cells. That is the buy, and it is real.
#
# WHAT IT SELLS, first half: EVENNESS -- the one property both torus readings found the digest
# hands over for free. Pearson chi-squared on cell occupancy over 510 tracked files at a 64-cell
# grid: the digest read 79.05 against a p=0.001 critical value of 103.51 at 63 degrees of freedom,
# and the prefix key read 13134.05. That is 127 times its own critical value, on a population where
# the digest is comfortably even. The sale is not marginal.
#
# WHAT IT SELLS, second half: CONFIDENTIALITY -- and this is the reading the other two exist to
# frame. The argument is one sentence: a key preserving a relation on its inputs hands that same
# relation to anyone holding only keys. Measured as ROOM RECOVERY -- the share of files an observer
# holding keys alone places in the right room by guessing each cell's plurality. Over 44 rooms the
# no-key baseline is 0.3471, the digest key reads 0.3980, and the prefix key reads 0.5353. So the
# key alone names the room of more than half the population.
#
# THE CONCLUSION THIS LANE EARNS. Locality, evenness and confidentiality are not three properties
# to be traded against one another by a clever key. They are one quantity read in three directions:
# a key that lets a reader find neighbours is a key that groups documents unevenly, and a key that
# groups documents is a key that tells an observer which group each document is in. The avalanche
# the two torus readings kept running into is what BUYS the other two, and it is doing its job.
#
# WHAT IS GATED HERE, and what is only reported. The control, and the live reading's ARITHMETIC:
# no digest survives a deep edit, every prefix does, and the recovery figures lie between their own
# no-key baseline and one. Those are facts about the keys rather than about this tree. The three
# TRADE verdicts and every chi-squared and mean figure are REPORTED rather than gated: a p=0.001
# test refuses about one run in a thousand on a key behaving correctly, and the means move with the
# tree's own contents, so a gate on them would red on honest work.
#
# WHAT IS PROVEN, on metal, by tools/fixtures/l/locality_key_control.sh -- 43 behaviors on planted
# populations in a throwaway pen, with the digest column swept evenly in every one so that only the
# prefix and the room move:
#
#   A TRADED POPULATION -- rooms that share prefixes -- sells evenness and the room together, and
#     passes, so the selling verdict is reachable rather than constant.
#   A FLAT POPULATION -- the same rooms, prefixes swept evenly -- sells NOTHING on either half and
#     reads its same-room names no closer. This is the falsifier shown fired, and it is the leg
#     that separates a measurement from a foregone conclusion.
#   A SCRAMBLED POPULATION -- prefixes clustered exactly as in the traded one, rooms assigned round
#     robin -- sells evenness and keeps the room. Unevenness and leakage are shown to be separable,
#     so the confidentiality reading is its own reading rather than a restatement of the chi.
#   THE WRAP is read on a population whose neighbours sit at cells 0 and 63 of a 64-cell ring.
#   THE ROWS DOOR carries no file to edit, so it reports zero probes and reads locality UNREAD
#     rather than claiming a yes it did not measure.
#   FOUR REFUSALS -- a population under the floor, an empty one, an absent file, an unknown flag.
#   FOUR MUTATIONS, each proven landed by cmp before its reading is believed: the plurality
#     baseline lost, the cyclic wrap removed, the per-cell maximum turned into a sum, and the
#     prefix probe counter silenced.
#
# WHAT IT LEAVES TO OTHERS. Whether a similarity-preserving sketch lands better on the same trade,
# which is a different key and wants its own reading. Whether the leak matters for a given corpus:
# room membership in a public tree is public, so this figure is a LOWER bound on what the key gives
# away over a corpus where it is not. Whether any locality key is safe to adopt, which is a custody
# question and never a measurement. And the real store, which this reading never opens.
#
# Style: context/GAUGE_STYLE.md
# Paper: active-designing/20260915-181000_the-key-that-carries-locality.md
#
# Run from the repository root:
#   rishi/bin/rishi run tools/l/locality_key_witness.rish

say "locality-key: Language EN -- a key is priced by what it sells, never by what it buys alone."
say "locality-key: Style Gauge, Meter -- every figure names its population, its grid, and its baseline."
say "locality-key: Lens TAME -- bound the sample, gate the arithmetic, report the statistic."

let control = run ["sh" "tools/fixtures/l/locality_key_control.sh"]
say control.out
assert control.ok else "locality-key: the control must complete -- its own lines are printed above"

# The selling case, so the live verdicts are readings rather than constants.
assert control.out contains "traded: the evenly swept digest reads even" else "locality-key: the digest must be shown even on the population where the prefix is not"
assert control.out contains "traded: the shared-prefix key does not" else "locality-key: a shared prefix must be seen as uneven"
assert control.out contains "traded: so evenness is sold" else "locality-key: the evenness half of the trade must be reachable"
assert control.out contains "traded: and the room is sold with it" else "locality-key: the confidentiality half must be reachable"
assert control.out contains "traded: same-room names sit closer" else "locality-key: the population reading of locality must be reachable"
assert control.out contains "traded: prefix recovery beats digest recovery" else "locality-key: recovery must be compared against the digest rather than against nothing"

# The falsifier, fired -- the leg that makes every figure above a measurement.
assert control.out contains "flat: an evenly swept prefix reads even" else "locality-key: a prefix carrying no locality must read even"
assert control.out contains "flat: so nothing is sold" else "locality-key: the instrument must be able to answer no on evenness"
assert control.out contains "flat: and no room is recovered" else "locality-key: the instrument must be able to answer no on confidentiality"
assert control.out contains "flat: same-room names sit no closer" else "locality-key: the instrument must be able to answer no on locality"

# Unevenness and leakage are separable, or the confidentiality reading says nothing new.
assert control.out contains "scrambled: the clustered prefix is uneven" else "locality-key: the scrambled population must still read uneven"
assert control.out contains "scrambled: yet the room is NOT" else "locality-key: leakage must be shown separable from unevenness"

# The wrap, and the door that declines rather than guessing.
assert control.out contains "wrapedge: cells 0 and 63 sit one apart on a 64-cell ring" else "locality-key: the cyclic distance must be read on its own edge"
assert control.out contains "rows: no file to edit, so no probe is claimed" else "locality-key: a door with no files must claim no probes"
assert control.out contains "rows: and locality reads unread, never yes" else "locality-key: an unread reading must be named unread"
assert control.out contains "tiny: a population under the floor is unreadable" else "locality-key: too small a population is unreadable"
assert control.out contains "empty: an empty rows file is unreadable" else "locality-key: an empty population is unreadable rather than clean"
assert control.out contains "missing: an absent rows file is refused" else "locality-key: an absent file is refused by name"
assert control.out contains "flag: an unknown flag is refused" else "locality-key: an unknown flag is refused rather than ignored"

# The probes, run on real bytes inside the control as well as live below.
assert control.out contains "live: no digest survives a deep edit" else "locality-key: the digest must move for every probe"
assert control.out contains "live: every prefix does" else "locality-key: the prefix must survive every probe"

# The mutations, each proven landed before its reading is believed.
assert control.out contains "m_plurality: the mutation applied" else "locality-key: a plant that changed no byte tests the real scan twice"
assert control.out contains "m_plurality: and the baseline it prints is the wrong one" else "locality-key: the no-key baseline must be computed rather than assumed"
assert control.out contains "m_wrap: the mutation applied" else "locality-key: the wrap plant must land before its reading"
assert control.out contains "m_wrap: without the wrap the same two cells read the long way round" else "locality-key: the distance must be cyclic"
assert control.out contains "m_best: the mutation applied" else "locality-key: the recovery plant must land before its reading"
assert control.out contains "m_best: summing instead of maxing recovers everything and breaks the identity check" else "locality-key: recovery must be a per-cell maximum"
assert control.out contains "m_probe: the mutation applied" else "locality-key: the probe plant must land before its reading"
assert control.out contains "m_probe: a prefix probe that never counts refuses the reading" else "locality-key: the probe counter must be load-bearing"

assert control.out contains "legs_expected=43" else "locality-key: the control counts its own legs, so an empty pen cannot read as a full one"
assert control.out contains "control_fail=0" else "locality-key: every behavior must be satisfied"
assert control.out contains "control_verdict=ok" else "locality-key: the control must balance before it is believed"

# The live reading, on the tree's own bytes.
let live = run ["sh" "tools/fixtures/l/locality_key_scan.sh" "--names" "256" "--grid" "8"]
say live.out
assert live.ok else "locality-key: the live reading must run on this tree, whatever it answers"
assert live.out contains "instrument=locality_key" else "locality-key: the reading names its own instrument"
assert live.out contains "source=git_ls_files" else "locality-key: the live population is the tree's own tracked bytes"
assert live.out contains "chi_critical=" else "locality-key: the critical value is published beside the statistic it judges"
assert live.out contains "roomdist_expected=" else "locality-key: the uniform expectation is published beside the means it judges"
assert live.out contains "plurality_room_share=" else "locality-key: the no-key baseline is published beside the recovery it judges"
assert live.out contains "edit_survive_digest=0" else "locality-key: no digest may survive a deep edit"
assert live.out contains "locality_bought=yes" else "locality-key: the prefix key must survive every probe on real bytes"
assert live.out contains "recovery_in_range=yes" else "locality-key: recovery must lie between its own baseline and one"
assert live.out contains "verdict=ok" else "locality-key: the live arithmetic must hold on this tree"

say "GREEN: locality-key -- 43 behaviors, both verdicts reachable from planted populations, unevenness shown separable from leakage, four mutations bitten, and the door both torus readings left open now priced."
